Account creation rules
• Students sign up with their college email and enrolment number, then wait in a Pending state until the office verifies them (or they are bulk-imported and receive an invite email).
• Faculty, HOD, Accounts, Admin, and Librarian accounts are created by invitation only.
• Parents are invited by the office or linked by a student-generated, single-use link code that the office approves.
• Only a Super Admin can create or demote an Admin.
